  "comment": {
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0f212807d7bbe91a49a7c4620c5bfdac?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FBP-1.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Ben Pennell",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5bba58f3eb6f6e2ccfd097c6",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "There was a typo in the original command in the ticket description, so that error is not valid. However, the ticket is still valid as you cannot create historic versions of external binaries because the VersionService has no way to receive external content uris currently.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "A corrected command:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "attrs": {
         "language": "java"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "curl -i -XPUT -H \"Link: <http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource>; rel=\\\"type\\\"\" -H \"Link: <https://duraspace.org/wp-content/themes/duraspace/assets/images/whitedura.png>; rel=\\\"http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent\\\"; handling=\\\"proxy\\\"; type=\\\"image/png\\\"\" \"http://localhost:8080/rest/put_v2\" -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This produces a memento as a FedoraInternalBinary with no content and no proxyUri property.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Also, to create the associated fcr:metadata memento (although this is not necessary to reproduce this bug):",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "attrs": {
         "language": "java"
        },
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "echo '@prefix premis:  <http://www.loc.gov/premis/rdf/v1#> .\r\n@prefix test:  <info:fedora/test/> .\r\n@prefix pcdm:  <http://pcdm.org/models#> .\r\n@prefix memento:  <http://mementoweb.org/ns#> .\r\n@prefix rdfs:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .\r\n@prefix webac:  <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/webac#> .\r\n@prefix acl:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/auth/acl#> .\r\n@prefix ns001:  <http://www.iana.org/assignments/relation/> .\r\n@prefix xsi:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance> .\r\n@prefix xmlns:  <http://www.w3.org/2000/xmlns/> .\r\n@prefix rdf:  <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\r\n@prefix fedora:  <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#> .\r\n@prefix xml:  <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .\r\n@prefix ebucore:  <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#> .\r\n@prefix ldp:  <http://www.w3.org/ns/ldp#> .\r\n@prefix xs:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema> .\r\n@prefix fedoraconfig:  <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/config#> .\r\n@prefix foaf:  <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .\r\n@prefix dc:  <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> .<http://localhost:8080/rest/put_v2>\r\n        rdf:type                 fedora:NonRdfSourceDescription ;\r\n        rdf:type                 fedora:Binary ;\r\n        rdf:type                 fedora:Resource ;\r\n        fedora:lastModifiedBy    \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\r\n        premis:hasSize           \"4167\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#long> ;\r\n        ebucore:hasMimeType      \"image/png\" ;\r\n        fedora:createdBy         \"fedoraAdmin\" ;\r\n        fedora:created           \"2018-07-03T19:00:28.354Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\r\n        fedora:lastModified      \"2018-07-03T19:00:28.354Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;\r\n        ebucore:filename         \"\" ;\r\n        rdf:type                 ldp:NonRDFSource ;\r\n        fedora:writable          true ;\r\n        ns001:describedby        <http://localhost:8080/rest/put_v2/fcr:metadata> ;\r\n        fedora:hasFixityService  <http://localhost:8080/rest/put_v2/fcr:fixity> .' | curl -XPOST -H \"Content-Type: text/turtle\" -H \"Memento-Datetime: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 GMT\" --data-binary \"@-\" http://localhost:8080/rest/put_v2/fcr:metadata/fcr:versions -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "codeBlock"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
