  "description": "<p><tt>Creating a versioned external binary works, as well as creating a memento from the current version. However, creating an external historic memento fails. See the following commands:</tt></p>\n\n<p><tt>curl -i -XPOST -H \"Slug:logov\"</tt> <tt>-H \"Link: &lt;<a href=\"http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://mementoweb.org/ns#OriginalResource</a>&gt;; rel=\\\"type\\\"\"</tt> <tt>\"Link: &lt;<a href=\"https://duraspace.org/wp-content/themes/duraspace/assets/images/whitedura.png\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://duraspace.org/wp-content/themes/duraspace/assets/images/whitedura.png</a>&gt;; rel=\\\"<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent</a>\\\"; handling=\\\"proxy\\\"; type=\\\"image/png\\\"\"</tt> <tt>\"http://localhost:8080/rest/\"</tt> <tt>-ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin</tt><br/>\n  <br/>\n <tt>curl -XPOST http:</tt><tt>//localhost:8080/rest/logov/fcr:versions -H \"Memento-Datetime: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 GMT\" -H \"Link: &lt;<a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/download/attachments/31655033/fedora_logo_2in.png\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/download/attachments/31655033/fedora_logo_2in.png</a>&gt;; rel=\\\"<a href=\"http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora.info/definitions/fcrepo#ExternalContent</a>\\\"; handling=\\\"proxy\\\"; type=\\\"image/png\\\"\" -ufedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin</tt><br/>\n  <br/>\n <tt>#Response:</tt><br/>\n <tt># &lt; HTTP/</tt><tt>1.1</tt> <tt>415</tt> <tt>Unsupported Media Type</tt><br/>\n <tt># Invalid Content Type application/octet-stream</tt></p>",
